# FCM service-account keys (the JSON from Firebase → Service accounts).
# These grant server-side access to the Firebase project — unlike
# google-services.json, which ships inside the app binary and is not a
# secret. Uploaded to EAS credentials, never committed.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
service-account*.json
firebase-service-account*.json
